    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "ba834b33a73f79f80d711dad0efb2894",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"lstm-encoder-lstm-vs-mlp-decoder-lstm_seq2seq\">LSTM encoder + LSTM vs MLP decoder: <code>lstm_seq2seq</code></h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Compare two autoregressive CNR predictors sharing the same LSTM encoder:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>Seq2Seq</code></strong> \u2014 LSTM decoder, sliding-window AR rollout with teacher forcing.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Seq2Scalar</code></strong> \u2014 MLP head on top hidden state, same sliding-window AR rollout.</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Encoder compresses CNR + stim features history \u2192 hidden state.\nDecoder (LSTM or MLP) takes hidden state + future stim features \u2192 next-step delta CNR.\nBoth use annealed teacher forcing.</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>param</th>\n<th>value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>source</td>\n<td>synthetic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hidden_dim</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>num_layers</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>history_len</td>\n<td>30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>future_len</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lr</td>\n<td>0.001</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>epochs</td>\n<td>50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>batch_size</td>\n<td>64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>patience</td>\n<td>20</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tf_ratio_start</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tf_ratio_end</td>\n<td>0.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dropout</td>\n<td>0.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mlp_hidden</td>\n<td>auto (= hidden_dim = 16)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>n_mlp_layers</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dry_run</td>\n<td>True</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": [
        {
          "type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": "{'hidden_dim': 16, 'num_layers': 2, 'history_len': 30, 'future_len': 5, 'lr': 0.001, 'epochs': 50, 'batch_size': 64, 'patience': 20, 'tf_ratio_start': 1.0, 'tf_ratio_end': 0.0, 'dropout': 0.1, 'mlp_hidden': None, 'n_mlp_layers': 5}\n",
          "mimetype": "text/plain"
